perf: Fix addr_filter_ranges lifetime

jira KERNEL-1784
cve CVE-2026-93817
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.59.1.el9_8
commit-author Peter Zijlstra <peterz@infradead.org>
commit e62d4192e593630f355094adc467058a05bdc935
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.59.1.el9_8/e62d4192.failed

Lee Jia Jie reported that since event::addr_filter_ranges is used
under RCU, it should be RCU freed.

	Reported-by: Lee Jia Jie <jiajie.lee@starlabs.sg>
	Signed-off-by: Peter Zijlstra (Intel) <peterz@infradead.org>
(cherry picked from commit e62d4192e593630f355094adc467058a05bdc935)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

